# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DO NOT list these -- .gitignore hides them from git, but a Dockerfile COPY
# does not read .gitignore. The image needs every one of them:
#
#   .secrets/          gargle OAuth token (refresh_token present -> headless)
#   google_data.rds    monitoring data, read at app.R:154
#   chem_data.rds      MSU lab data, read at app.R:157 AND written at :147
#   user_base.csv      shinyauthr credentials, read at funs.R:98
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
